direction: down

tsrx: Authored .tsrx
scan: Shared structural scan
projection: Type-semantic projection
ordinary: Authored TS and TSX
config: Per-file config resolution
batch: In-memory virtual source batch
tsgolint: One documented tsgolint v2 process
mapping: Path-aware labels and fixes
spans: Authored TSRX spans

tsrx -> scan -> projection -> batch
ordinary -> batch
config -> batch
batch -> tsgolint -> mapping -> spans
